DESCRIPTION:• Take a guided farm tour at 12:00\, 1:00\, and 2:00 of our organic CSA.\n• Explore the greenhouses\, pick-your-own fields\, get your questions answered\, and go home with a DIY project.\n• Kids activities • Photo booth • Nature craft for families • Acorn Acres’ ambassador animals • Live music by The 20s Band!\n\nPicnics encouraged! Please\, no dogs.\nDrop in any time. Golf cart tours and accessible parking. Free off-street parking. \nBack by popular demand: Delicious food from Koshary Station will be available for purchase. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Register Now
