SUMMARY:Nourish Your Noodle Dinner & Auction
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate a milestone 70 years in the making! Join us for the 70th Anniversary of Mental Health America of Lancaster County at Lancaster’s iconic Southern Market. Savor globally inspired cuisine\, enjoy a cash bar\, bid on live and silent auction items\, and take part in a brief program highlighting how your support helps thousands of individuals each year live mentally healthy lives. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
