SUMMARY:Lancaster Mennonite School: Spring Open House
DESCRIPTION:JOIN US FOR AN OPEN HOUSE ON April 25\, 2026 FROM 2:30– 4:30PM\nLancaster Mennonite School will be holding an Open House for grades PreK-12th on Saturday\, April 25\, 2026 from 2:30– 4:30PM\n\nDrop-in during that time for tours\, talk with teachers and administrators\, learn about unique programs and exciting offerings\, and experience the caring\, diverse community that represents the LM difference! Interested students\, parents and guardians grades PreK-12th are welcome to join us!\n\nAfter your tour stick around for our annual Spring Celebration: Auction\, Food & Fun. The event is on campus\, and will include food trucks\, concession stand\, bake sale\, plant sale\, live auction\, and kids activities including inflatables and other fun for all ages. There will also be an all school musical of Alexander and the Terrible\, Horrible\, No Good\, Very Bad Day! We hope you will save the date to join us for this community event! More information is available on our website: https://www.lancastermennonite.org/events/spring-celebration-2026/ \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-mennonite-school-spring-open-house-2/
LOCATION:Lancaster Mennonite School\, 2176 Lincoln Highway East\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/03/Landing-Page-header-2000x600-1.avif
END:VEVENT
