SUMMARY:Spring Celebration 2026: Benefit Auction\, Food & Fun
DESCRIPTION:The Lancaster Mennonite Spring Celebration is always a highly anticipated event for students\, their families\, and the broader community. This fun-filled day features kids activities\, a benefit auction\, plant and bake sale\, delicious concessions\, a collection of Lancaster’s favorite food trucks and more. \n\nSchedule of Events: \n2:30 – 4:30 — Spring Open House\n2:30 – 6:30 — Food Trucks\n3:00 – 6:30 — Plant Sale\, bake sale\, concessions\, and silent auction\n3:00 – 4:30 — Kids Activities\n4:30 – 5:30 — Live Auction\n4:30 – 6:30 — Playground Open\n6:30 – 7:30 —All School Musical\n7:30- 8:00 — Snacks/Concessions outside the Fine Arts Center \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/spring-celebration-2026-benefit-auction-food-fun/
