SUMMARY:Fulton Theatre's Annual Gala: The Beat Goes On
DESCRIPTION:Bring on the ’60s with the Fulton Theatre on Saturday\, April 25 at the Ware Center for the Arts for their 2026 gala\, The Beat Goes On. This year’s theme is inspired by the high-energy and outta-sight spirit of their upcoming production of Hairspray\, on stage from April 10 through May 3. \n\n\n\nThe gala will be emceed by News 8’s Katelyn Smith and features an all-vinyl dance party with DJ Major Vibes\, spinning hits from the late 1950s and early 1960s. Attendees will enjoy performances\, a silent and live auction\, and exceptional cuisine from TBF Catering\, Cracked Pepper\, and GEM’s Catering. \n\n\n\n\n    tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/fulton-theatres-annual-gala-the-beat-goes-on/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
