SUMMARY:My Mom Is Here Band at Launch Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join Marion Court Room during Launch Music Conference & Festival for a live performance by My Mom Is Here. \n\n\n\nFormed by a group of jazz-trained musicians at Columbia\, the band has grown into a high-energy live act known for their dynamic sound. They recently released their single “The Lucky Dudes\,” recorded at Power Station at BerkleeNYC with full horn and string arrangements\, and are currently working toward their debut full-length album. \n\n\n\nCome out for a night of live music and discover what’s next for this rising group. \n\n\n\n\n    more info
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/my-mom-is-here-band-at-launch-music-festival/
